(PART C — INTERNAL WIRING AND EARTHING) Tj T*
(\(a\) The internal wiring installation shall comply with IS 732:2019.) Tj T*
(\(b\) Earthing arrangement of the installation shall be TN-S system.) Tj T*
(\(c\) All wiring shall be drawn through heavy gauge PVC conduits recessed in walls. All) Tj T*
(enclosures shall be of adequate size to accommodate the equipment.) Tj T*
(\(d\) Building wires shall be 1100 V grade PVC insulated multistrand copper conductor as per IS) Tj T*
(694:2010.) Tj T*
(\(e\) Minimum conductor size shall be 1.5 Sq.mm for lighting points and 4 Sq.mm for power points.) Tj T*
(\(f\) MCBs shall be C-curve, as per IS/IEC 60898-1, with rated short circuit capacity of 10 kA.) Tj T*
(\(g\) Final circuit MCBs shall be rated between 6 Amps and 32 Amps.) Tj T*
(\(h\) Socket outlet circuits shall be protected by 30 mA RCCBs conforming to IS 12640 \(Part 1\).) Tj T*
(The earthing system shall be designed and installed as per IS 3043:2018.) Tj T*
(\(i\) Main distribution board shall be earthed through two separate pipe earth electrodes.) Tj T*
(\(j\) Combined resistance of the earthing system shall be less than 1 Ohm.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(4 TESTS AND INSPECTION) Tj T*
(\(a\) Samples of wires shall be tested as per IS 10810 at the manufacturer's works.) Tj T*
(\(b\) The complete wiring shall be tested before handing over.) Tj T*
(\(c\) Pre-dispatch inspection shall be offered to the Department's authorised representative with) Tj T*
(15 days notice.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(5 DOCUMENTATION, WARRANTY AND TRAINING) Tj T*
(\(a\) Shop drawings and schematic diagrams shall be got approved from the Engineer-in-charge) Tj T*
(before manufacture.) Tj T*
(\(b\) O&M manuals, as-built drawings and catalogues shall be furnished in triplicate at the time) Tj T*
(of handing over.) Tj T*
(\(c\) The supplier shall replace free of cost any part found defective within the defect) Tj T*
(liability period of 24 months.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Signature of Bidder) Tj T*
